    Hello everyone,
    
    Values Week is coming up! From [DATES], we’ll take time as a company to celebrate and reflect on our 
values — especially how we treat one another. This year’s focus is on respect, fairness, and building a 
workplace where everyone can thrive.
    
    What to expect
    - Listening sessions & town hall: Share experiences and hear from colleagues and leadership.
    - Workshops & activities: Practical sessions on inclusive behavior, psychological safety, and career 
development.
    - Employee stories: We’ll feature short reflections from teammates about values in action.
    
    Why this matters
