    Hello everyone,
    
    Values Week is coming up! From [DATES], we’ll take time as a company to celebrate and reflect on our 
values — especially how we treat one another. This year, we’re centering our conversations on respect, 
fairness, and shared prosperity. We believe that striving for more equitable outcomes is essential to our
long-term success.
    
    What to expect
