    Our culture and systems determine how fairly we share value. Values Week is a chance to listen and to
surface concrete, actionable steps — from closing wage gaps to piloting collective benefits and 
strengthening transparency around compensation decisions. We want to explore solutions collaboratively 
and ensure every voice is heard.
    
    How you can get involved
    - RSVP for events: [calendar link]
    - Share a story or suggestion: [form link] or use #[HASHTAG]
    - Join the town hall on [DATE/TIME]
    
