feedback and consider concrete steps such as a compensation review, targeted pay equity analysis, pilot 
programs for shared benefits, and workstreams to address gaps.
    
    A note on personal viewpoints
    Personal perspectives are welcome in opt-in channels. If you’d like help crafting a personal note 
that expresses your views on fairness and shared prosperity in non-political terms, I can help.
    
    Thanks,
    Emily
    Values Week Lead
    

